      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on the launch strategy for our new ultra-premium fragrance line. we're looking to target a very specific high-net-worth audience to ensure the brand positioning is right from day one. can you help me build out a few detailed ideal consumer profiles? i need to know their general lifestyle, values, and even their likely ethnic or cultural backgrounds so we can tailor the ad creative and media buys specifically to them. thanks.",
